name: widening
kind: inferred
shape: categorical
face: in
membrane: false
note: a refusal, boundary, or v1 cut relaxes — something the surface
  refused loudly now works, not because a defect was fixed but because
  the contract grew a spelled exception. Distinct from capability-added
  (the verb or surface itself is new) and from defect-closed (behavior
  was wrong, now right): the mechanism existed and said no, and the
  ruling changed. The commit should name the prior cut and why it was
  safe to widen. First use: arm-carrying steps hoisting when the arms
  are a lane verb's declared vocabulary (std/tree:fold).
